        "content": "# Development Tasks: YAML Validator Command\n\n**Feature ID**: yaml-validator\n**Status**: Not Started\n**Progress**: 0% (0 of 8 tasks)\n**Estimated Effort**: 2 days\n**Started**: 2026-02-01\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement a YAML syntax validation command integrated into the rp1 CLI. The command (`rp1 validate-yaml`) validates one or more YAML files, reports errors with line numbers, and returns appropriate exit codes for CI/CD integration. Uses the `js-yaml` package (added as a project dependency) for YAML parsing.\n\n## Implementation DAG\n\n**Parallel Groups** (tasks with no inter-dependencies):\n\n1. [T0, T1] - Dependency addition and interface types have no dependencies\n2. [T2, T3] - YAML Validator and CLI Dispatcher can proceed after their prerequisites\n3. [T4] - Validate-YAML Command requires interfaces and validator\n4. [T5] - Tests require all implementations\n\n**Dependencies**:\n\n- T2 -> T0 (validator uses js-yaml package)\n- T3 -> T1 (dispatcher imports Command interface)\n- T4 -> T1 (command implements Command interface)\n- T4 -> T2 (command uses yaml-validator lib)\n- T5 -> [T2, T3, T4] (tests require all implementations)\n\n**Critical Path**: T0 -> T2 -> T4 -> T5\n\n## Task Breakdown\n\n### Foundation\n\n- [ ] **T0**: Add js-yaml dependency to package.json `[complexity:simple]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#4-technology-stack](design.md#4-technology-stack)\n\n    **Effort**: 30 minutes\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] js-yaml package added to package.json dependencies\n    - [ ] Package installed successfully via bun install\n    - [ ] TypeScript types available for js-yaml\n\n- [ ] **T1**: Define Command interface and types in src/commands/types.ts `[complexity:simple]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#32-interface-definitions](design.md#32-interface-definitions)\n\n    **Effort**: 1 hour\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] CommandResult interface defined with exitCode property\n    - [ ] Command interface defined with name, description, usage, and execute method\n    - [ ] Types exported for use by other modules\n\n### Core Implementation\n\n- [ ] **T2**: Implement YAML validator library in src/lib/yaml-validator.ts `[complexity:simple]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#35-yaml-validator-design](design.md#35-yaml-validator-design)\n\n    **Effort**: 2 hours\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] ValidationSuccess and ValidationError interfaces defined\n    - [ ] validateYamlContent function parses YAML and returns ValidationResult\n    - [ ] validateYamlFile function reads file and validates content\n    - [ ] Line numbers are 1-indexed for user display\n    - [ ] Empty content returns valid result\n    - [ ] js-yaml YAMLException errors are properly caught and converted\n\n- [ ] **T3**: Implement CLI dispatcher with command routing in src/index.ts `[complexity:medium]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#33-cli-dispatcher-design](design.md#33-cli-dispatcher-design)\n\n    **Effort**: 3 hours\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] CLI parses process.argv to extract command name and arguments\n    - [ ] Command registry lookup implemented\n    - [ ] Global --help flag shows available commands\n    - [ ] Per-command --help flag shows command usage\n    - [ ] Unknown commands display error and exit with code 1\n    - [ ] Command execute result determines process exit code\n\n### Command Implementation\n\n- [ ] **T4**: Implement validate-yaml command handler in src/commands/validate-yaml.ts `[complexity:medium]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#34-validate-yaml-command-design](design.md#34-validate-yaml-command-design)\n\n    **Effort**: 3 hours\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] Command implements Command interface\n    - [ ] Requires at least one file argument (shows usage otherwise)\n    - [ ] Validates all provided files (does not stop on first error)\n    - [ ] Outputs \"filename: valid\" for valid files\n    - [ ] Outputs \"filename: error on line