        "content": "# Hypothesis Document: yaml-validator\n**Version**: 1.0.0 | **Created**: 2026-02-01T03:17:56Z | **Status**: PENDING\n\n## Hypotheses\n### HYP-001: Bun runtime includes js-yaml as a built-in module\n**Risk Level**: HIGH\n**Status**: PENDING\n**Statement**: Bun runtime includes js-yaml as a built-in module that can be imported without adding to package.json dependencies\n**Context**: The entire YAML parsing capability depends on this. If js-yaml is not bundled with Bun, we would need to either add it as a dependency (violating REQ-009) or implement custom YAML parsing.\n**Validation Criteria**:\n- CONFIRM if: Successfully import js-yaml in a Bun script and parse YAML without adding to package.json; verify YAMLException provides line/column info\n- REJECT if: Import fails with module not found error, or parsing does not provide line number information\n**Suggested Method**: CODE_EXPERIMENT\n\n## Validation Findings\n"
